    cycloFactsP2R32, cycloFactsP2R64, cycloFactsP2R128, cycloFactsP3R1, cycloFactsP3R3,
    cycloFactsP3R9, cycloFactsP3R27, cycloFactsP3R81, cycloFactsP5R1, cycloFactsP5R5,
    cycloFactsP5R25, cycloFactsP7R1, cycloFactsP7R7, cycloFactsP7R49, cycloFactsP11R1,
    cycloFactsP11R11, cycloFactsP13R1, cycloFactsP13R13, cycloFactsP17R1, cycloFactsP19R1]

